	<entry>
		<title>Live coverage from Madonna &amp; Smirnoff Party at Roseland Ballroom</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/241-live-coverage-from-madonna-smirnoff-party-at-roseland-ballroom.html"/>
		<published>2011-11-13T02:28:31Z</published>
		<updated>2011-11-13T02:28:31Z</updated>
		<id>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/241-live-coverage-from-madonna-smirnoff-party-at-roseland-ballroom.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DrownedMadonna.com&lt;/strong&gt; collaborator &lt;strong&gt;Tony Albanese&lt;/strong&gt; are doing his best to cover live tonight exclusive &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; danceevent from &lt;strong&gt;New York's Roseland Ballroom&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;Everyone keep checking the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;DrownedMadonna Facebook&lt;/a&gt; page tonight (&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;http://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna&lt;/a&gt;),&quot; &lt;strong&gt;Tony&lt;/strong&gt; says. &quot;I will be doing real time updates and posting photos and videos throughout the evening. It promises to be a fun, unique night and I will take you along for the experience!&quot; &lt;strong&gt;Please join our Facebook page.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recommend to stay tuned also to &lt;strong&gt;DrownedMadonna newspage&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People are about to enter the &lt;strong&gt;Roseland Ballroom&lt;/strong&gt; now. Tonight &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; is going to choose a &lt;strong&gt;dancer&lt;/strong&gt; who will tour with her as well as performing with her at next year &lt;strong&gt;Super Bowl&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;Martin Solveig&lt;/strong&gt; is attending and playing at the party.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;The VIP line is insane,&quot; reports &lt;strong&gt;Tony&lt;/strong&gt;. &quot;But the GA line is even crazier!&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/img/roseland/01.jpg&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; alt=&quot;people queuing for Madonna at Roseland Ballroom&quot; width=&quot;790&quot; height=&quot;1322&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
